{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Twist the rules of blackjack by playing custom cards from your hand. Each card has a range of possible values, revealed only when played. Get as close to 21 as possible without going over to outplay the dealer and deal damage!</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810010/extras/overdrawn21V-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1750558378\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose the cards you play wisely! Some cards will increase your strength to deal more damage or gain shield to absorb hits. Don't go over 21!\u00a0</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810010/extras/overdrawnVG1-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1750558378\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Purchase cards will unique abilities to gain an advantage again the dealers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810010/extras/overdrawnCG2-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1750558378\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your card's suits and possible values while building a powerful deck! Each run the cards possible values and suits are randomized to make each run feel different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5+ hours of gameplay &amp; loads of replay ability\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ playing cards and permanent  abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Achievements\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810010?t=1750558378","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810010?t=1750558378